{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/459349-aberrant-dice-rolling-question","id":459349,"title":"Aberrant dice rolling question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-27T13:42:29-07:00","id":459349,"title":"Aberrant dice rolling question","content":"Ok I can't seem to find this in the book but I swear I remember it being in there some where. Though I suppose it could be something from Scion or Exalted bleeding over into my memory. Do nova's count 10s twice? If so can some one point me to the page in the rulebook I need to look at?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5371-sahugani","name":"Sahugani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5371_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-27T18:00:29-07:00","id":459556,"title":"","content":"No.<br /> <br /> You can reroll 10s if you have an applicable Quality on an Attribute, as described on page 134. Otherwise 10s are just another success. They do not count double.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-28T03:42:38-07:00","id":459805,"title":"","content":"Much Appreciated!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5371-sahugani","name":"Sahugani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5371_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-28T11:30:35-07:00","id":460222,"title":"","content":"Unless you were referring to the rule for Mega Attribute dice, in which case a ten counts as three successes and a 7-9 counts as two successes. Aberrant main rulebook page 154.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There is no good or evil. There is only instinct corrupted by intelligence.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5273-kingofdreams","name":"KingOfDreams","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5273_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}